Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.56,0:02:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.49,0:03:21.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:23.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快回到你们家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get into your houses, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.81,0:03:43.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.52,0:03:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:47.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们得后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.40,0:04:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.33,0:04:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.38,0:04:40.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:44.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪安娜  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deanna, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:49.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god. Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.49,0:05:18.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.19,0:06:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  能收到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.89,0:06:20.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.69,0:06:25.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.48,0:06:33.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里  尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}In here, Eugene!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:48.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.52,0:06:51.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  你没事  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, you're safe. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.94,0:06:55.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}There!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.23,0:06:57.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好枪法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.63,0:06:58.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}There!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.95,0:07:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走  朱迪思在我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I have Judith!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.82,0:07:56.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸往东边的墙去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The walkers are flooding into the east wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.15,0:07:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就说明西边的墙会最先清空\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means that the west wall will be the first to clear up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:08:00.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们从那里进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's-- that's how we get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔倒了并不意味着...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because the tower's down doesn't mean that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.08,0:08:10.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  里面的人还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, people are still alive in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.50,0:08:16.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.21,0:08:21.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总是会这样  格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it always happens, Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.07,0:08:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还在  我们的朋友在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still here. Our friends are in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:26.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关心你的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}people who care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:28.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怀孕的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My pregnant wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:35.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想跑开  心怀恐惧  忘了这一切吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just want to run away, be afraid, forget about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.37,0:08:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:41.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你就是这样失去人们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's how you lose people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.63,0:08:46.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至是在他们死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even after they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.64,0:09:00.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-把她放在沙发上  -楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put her on the couch. - Upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.16,0:09:02.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,左手边第一个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}First room on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:04.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.27,0:09:06.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-在哪  -右边这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - This one on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.47,0:09:09.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-哪个房间  -进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which room? - Go in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.98,0:09:13.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山姆  你得关掉音乐  合上百叶窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I need you to turn off the music and shut the blinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.33,0:09:14.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为那些怪物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of the monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:27.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你待在这里  保持安静  \N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay up here and you stay quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.62,0:09:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会没事的  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.30,0:09:31.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-妈  -亲爱的  努力装一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom-- - Honey, just-- just try. Just pretend--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.01,0:09:33.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装作你不害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just pretend that you're somebody who's not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.37,0:09:34.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-努力装一下吧  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just try. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.29,0:09:36.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  我爱你  我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I love you. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:09.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me take a look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.71,0:10:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:16.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你谁都不信任  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't trust anybody, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.37,0:10:20.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那要分人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some more than others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.57,0:10:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你是我最不信任的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're dead last.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.32,0:10:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我们彼此坦诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least we're being honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.45,0:10:36.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不信任你  但我从没想过你在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust you, but I never thought you were lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.85,0:10:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面怎样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.94,0:10:49.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满大街都是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're filling the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:10:59.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可能脑震荡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that's probably a concussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.61,0:11:01.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快坐下歇会  不然要摔倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should sit down before you fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.33,0:11:03.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我没事  -卡萝尔...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am okay. - Carol...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.99,0:11:07.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管我们要解决什么事  都可以等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever we have to settle, it can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.28,0:11:09.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.26,0:11:32.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他不会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.69,0:11:38.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他会回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think he's coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.98,0:11:45.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以聊天的  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can talk, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.23,0:11:49.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没必要害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:52.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.77,0:11:55.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面有受伤的人  我那里还有病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's injured people out there. I have patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.49,0:11:57.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不应该在这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.18,0:12:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都不应该在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.02,0:12:04.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:05.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.67,0:12:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你干了那些事情之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the things you've done,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.47,0:12:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你属于这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you belong here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.14,0:12:15.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.69,0:12:20.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think I've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.29,0:12:21.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've killed people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.13,0:12:24.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们解放了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We freed them,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:26.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.12,0:12:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不过是准备利用一下剩下的东西而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were just going to use what was left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:35.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来之前并不知道是什么事  对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came here without knowing what this was, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.47,0:12:36.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道摩根把我关在了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Morgan had me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说过他不会放你走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he wouldn't let you go
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.31,0:12:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非他确定了你不会再杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}until he was sure you wouldn't kill again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.47,0:12:50.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是感染了而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just an infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.81,0:12:54.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前闯进了一辆车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was breaking into a car
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.69,0:12:57.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后被生锈的保险杆割伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cut myself on a rusty bumper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:12:59.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.39,0:13:04.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么公平不公平的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not unfair or just.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.09,0:13:07.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今没什么是不公平的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's unfair anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.35,0:13:12.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感染可能不会害死我  也可能会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might not kill me, but it might.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.02,0:13:15.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谋事在人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.48,0:13:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成事在天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world will take care of the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:20.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永恒不变\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.29,0:13:29.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我看看伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me the wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.83,0:14:03.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你生来不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't born this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.16,0:14:06.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.45,0:14:10.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能改变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.01,0:14:30.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她怎样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.46,0:14:33.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是针对米琼恩  但她在干的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense to Michonne, but whatever she's doing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.61,0:14:35.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我弄得疼死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}hurts like a son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.94,0:14:38.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚把腿部处理好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just finished with the leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.81,0:14:41.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来那是最严重的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that seems to be the worst of--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.11,0:15:08.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.39,0:15:11.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:20.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经开始发烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fever's setting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.10,0:15:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的时间不长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't have long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:29.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她清楚接下来会发生什么  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows how it happens, right? All of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:30.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  她清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.93,0:15:37.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她居然还有心思讲笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's cracking jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.15,0:15:42.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.11,0:15:44.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有你她逃不掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't have run.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.71,0:15:54.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,储备的食物足够我们撑一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have food to last us a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.19,0:15:59.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们迟早会聚起来  汇集到某处\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're bound to cluster up by then, move off to one area.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.86,0:16:02.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到那时我会想办法去武器库\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they do, I'll try and get to the armory...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:05.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它们引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Draw them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.97,0:16:09.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-用枪声吗  -照明弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- With guns? - Flares.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:12.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会把大门打开  发射照明弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll open the gate, fire them off...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.47,0:16:15.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看能不能把它们引到...\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if I can get them somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.17,0:16:18.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正引出这里就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere that's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给瑞克的那张设计图...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plans that you gave Rick...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.01,0:16:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我仔细看过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking them over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.47,0:16:29.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.63,0:16:31.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那计划行得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.72,0:16:33.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眼下你还这么想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.33,0:16:35.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深信不疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.19,0:16:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,空白处的拉丁文  是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}The latin in the margins, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.81,0:16:48.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是雷吉在情况很糟时常说的一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was something Reg used to say when things went really, really badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.96,0:16:54.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很幸运  米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm lucky, Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.80,0:16:59.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟家人一起  为了美好的未来而奋斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working with my family towards a better future is--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.44,0:17:02.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的毕生所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all I ever want
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:05.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我也得偿所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:12.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做了自己想做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to do what I wanted...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.41,0:17:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到最后一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}right up to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:22.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.93,0:17:27.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要这个地方运作下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want this place to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.21,0:17:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  但是那对你有什么意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but what does that mean for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.59,0:17:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.32,0:17:37.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.27,0:17:42.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.23,0:17:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ron?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.53,0:18:06.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.81,0:18:11.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.47,0:18:13.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:18.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我爸会想到办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, my dad's gonna figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:21.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他总是能想到  -胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He always does. - That's bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:25.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸只会害死更多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad's just gonna get more people killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.49,0:18:27.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他只会那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause that's what he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.95,0:18:30.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是那样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.01,0:18:34.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸是个杀人凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad's a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:36.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So was yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.65,0:18:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们得想办法  -我死了  卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need to work this out. - I'm dead, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.52,0:18:53.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.77,0:18:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我弟死了  -他们没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My brother is. - No, they're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.85,0:19:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会活下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.04,0:19:07.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸  你们也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad-- you're dead, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.36,0:19:13.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.33,0:19:32.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.11,0:19:34.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-卡尔  -罗恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl!  - Ron!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.71,0:19:37.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-让我进去  卡尔  -罗恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me in! Carl! - Ron!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.17,0:19:39.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.23,0:19:41.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗恩  马上开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ron, open the door right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.94,0:19:42.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.45,0:19:53.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮把手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.03,0:20:00.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  罗恩  过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Ron! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.12,0:20:04.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.47,0:20:19.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了  让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.04,0:20:23.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-小心  -让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch out! - Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:27.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个不够  而且我们得保持安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need more, and we need to be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.55,0:20:28.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去找找还有什么能用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see what I can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.95,0:20:30.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我也去  -帮把手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me, too. - Help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:33.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我来  -里面发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got it. - Hey, hey, what happened in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.13,0:20:35.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在找工具  结果打翻了一个架子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were looking for tools and knocked over a shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.78,0:20:38.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们听到了叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}We heard yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:40.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  罗恩看到它们冲破了门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Ron saw them break through the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.14,0:20:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.24,0:20:43.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.37,0:20:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  我妈卧室有床头柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, there's nightstands in my mom's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.10,0:20:46.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以用它们抵住沙发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can brace the couch with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.11,0:20:47.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -你们那时听起来像是在打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Hey, it sounded like you were fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.43,0:20:48.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  但我们是在跟行尸打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but we were fighting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.23,0:20:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl? It's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.34,0:20:56.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:07.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-听着  我...  -枪给我  枪柄对着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen, I, uh-- - Hand me the gun, grip first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.68,0:21:11.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-卡尔  对不起  -我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl, I'm sorry. - Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.22,0:21:13.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now give me the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.30,0:21:24.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.97,0:21:26.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.36,0:21:29.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸杀了你爸  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad killed your dad, but,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.02,0:21:30.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些事你得明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need to know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.40,0:21:33.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸是个混账\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad was an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.86,0:21:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们把雕像推倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They knocked the sculpture over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.40,0:21:49.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噪音引来了更多行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that noise, it's drawing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.31,0:21:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去照顾她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.36,0:22:28.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's still me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.91,0:22:33.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so-- I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.96,0:22:36.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.36,0:22:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想看她最后一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-- I wanted to see her one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.93,0:22:41.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我能走过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I could make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.28,0:22:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我的腿不听计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}My legs had other plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.07,0:22:45.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.07,0:22:48.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢点  慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.95,0:23:01.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就喜欢乱计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.60,0:23:04.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在是你的计划了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're yours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.04,0:23:11.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从现在起...\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.07,0:23:15.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须有人陪着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone needs to be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.36,0:23:16.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.80,0:23:21.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.12,0:23:24.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.47,0:23:29.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把她放到别的地方去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find someplace else to put her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.75,0:23:30.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.68,0:23:34.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh--
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.16,0:23:37.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我写了点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wrote something...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.08,0:23:42.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给斯宾塞和玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Spencer, for Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.35,0:23:48.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会送到他们手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make sure they get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.63,0:23:52.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能照顾好他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you look out for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.05,0:23:56.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我会的  -你会像照顾你的人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will. - Will you look out for him
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.86,0:24:00.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照顾好他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you look out for your people?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.22,0:24:05.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你猜怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess what.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.18,0:24:09.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都是你的人  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all your people, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.87,0:24:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.87,0:24:14.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情还没有发展成那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't had a chance to make it that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.89,0:24:16.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但已经是那样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.70,0:24:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我冲过去帮你不是因为我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't run over to help you out there because I like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.69,0:24:26.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是因为我认为你是一个好人  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Or because I think you're a good man,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.38,0:24:27.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个好父亲...\N{\fnArial\fs30}a good father...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.77,0:24:31.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是因为你能长出一嘴大胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or that you can grow one hell of a beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.85,0:24:37.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跑过去帮你是因为你是我们的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran over to help because you are one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.20,0:24:41.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这才是正确的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the right answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.89,0:24:46.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.40,0:25:02.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(世界史)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.11,0:25:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大部分人都跑进自己屋里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people got inside their houses. There's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.27,0:25:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得到此为止了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.18,0:25:18.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.08,0:25:21.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这地方完蛋了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think this place is over?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.81,0:25:24.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.59,0:25:29.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们所有人都应该努力争取\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we gotta earn it, all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.51,0:25:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是等着  得知大家是否安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether it's waiting, knowing if everyone's safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.36,0:25:38.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应对此事或者对抗它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}dealing with that, or fighting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.96,0:25:42.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住在这种地方总得付出相应的代价吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A place like this has gotta have a price, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.56,0:25:46.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们付出的还不够多吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't paid it already?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.59,0:25:49.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.22,0:26:04.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉亚伯拉罕已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels like Abraham's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.19,0:26:09.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what it feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.58,0:26:10.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.67,0:26:13.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.82,0:26:15.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I didn't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.57,0:26:17.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter what it feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.78,0:26:20.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还没死  这地方还没有完蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not dead, and this place isn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.92,0:26:24.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.65,0:26:29.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们要做什么  美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we gonna do, gorgeous?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.94,0:26:41.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们进屋子  看看另一边的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna get in there, see what's happening on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.92,0:26:43.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以用枪把锁崩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can shoot out this lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.99,0:26:48.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不应该浪费子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shouldn't waste the bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.58,0:26:52.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不需要用子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.03,0:27:01.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开锁是我的技能之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock-picking is within my skill set.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.64,0:27:25.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.88,0:27:28.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭目养神而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just resting my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.00,0:28:02.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.22,0:28:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just too many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.67,0:28:34.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人上楼  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody get upstairs now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.03,0:28:37.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.40,0:28:40.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.00,0:28:45.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.83,0:28:49.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用沙发\N{\fnArial\fs30}The couch!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.17,0:28:50.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把楼道封住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's block the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.38,0:29:08.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我搞定这个  你去搞定后面那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this one, you get the one behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.95,0:29:10.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少需要两只\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need at least two.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.58,0:29:21.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离他远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.05,0:29:23.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他被绑上了  他没有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's tied up, he's not--
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.08,0:29:24.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说离他远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said get away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.61,0:29:33.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事本可以等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could've waited.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.15,0:29:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该等等的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should have.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.14,0:29:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在等不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.43,0:29:48.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你待在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.64,0:29:50.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到它们挤进来就叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see anyone squeezing through, you get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.78,0:29:55.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要床单  足够所有人用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need bed sheets, enough for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.77,0:29:57.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要床单干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bed sheets for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.50,0:29:59.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起去武器库\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all go to the armory.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.71,0:30:02.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么去  -我们要把它们开膛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - We're gonna gut these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.96,0:30:04.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后披着内脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover ourselves with the insides.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.58,0:30:07.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这能掩盖气味  让它们觉得我们是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll mask our smell, make them think we're like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.26,0:30:10.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前也干过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.40,0:30:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们保持冷静  别引起它们的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stay calm, we don't draw attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.40,0:30:15.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就可以穿过尸群\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can move right through them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.82,0:30:18.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们在房子里  发出声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in the house, they're making noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.11,0:30:19.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会引来更多行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}More are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.98,0:30:40.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留在这会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone who stays here is gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.54,0:30:41.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪安娜怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Deanna?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.76,0:30:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不需要用刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.26,0:31:00.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.57,0:31:02.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  没什么好谈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.87,0:31:04.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能比他们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can be better than them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.56,0:31:06.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们本来就比他们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are better than them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.09,0:31:07.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀人就未必了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if we kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.14,0:31:11.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们逼我们杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made us kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.73,0:31:15.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须得阻止  我必须得阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to stop it. I had to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.02,0:31:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要活着  就有各种可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}With life, there's possibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.82,0:31:20.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使我们永远不放他出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if we never let him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.49,0:31:22.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我会出去的  -即使我们永远不放他出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'd get out. - Even if we never let him out,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.83,0:31:25.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也有可能反省他的所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}he could know what he's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.48,0:31:28.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他有可能...  -我不想杀你  摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He could know... - I don't want to have to kill you, Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.88,0:31:30.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.69,0:31:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.96,0:31:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.26,0:31:38.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让你杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.15,0:32:03.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.35,0:32:04.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们在涌进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're getting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.64,0:32:08.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们余下的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.99,0:32:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.19,0:32:18.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你要是想的话  我可以...  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you want me to, I'll-- - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.53,0:32:22.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.07,0:32:25.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.24,0:32:30.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.81,0:32:34.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.91,0:32:37.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我准备好时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.82,0:32:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会自己动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.72,0:32:48.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命是我自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.66,0:32:53.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己开头  自己结尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.46,0:33:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[拉丁语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.89,0:33:04.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.33,0:33:10.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"总有一天  你所承受过的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Someday this pain
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.69,0:33:14.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会有助于你"\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be useful to you."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.94,0:33:21.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.33,0:33:24.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.99,0:33:39.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.56,0:33:41.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.17,0:33:46.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢你还有信念\N{\fnArial\fs30}For believing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.34,0:33:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我依旧有信念\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.07,0:33:53.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我全搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cocked it all up...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.48,0:33:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我想明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...but I figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.78,0:34:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.12,0:34:09.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在该你想明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.96,0:34:13.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.16,0:34:15.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.89,0:34:18.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give'em hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.75,0:34:29.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了  你先走我随后\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to move. You, then me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.80,0:34:36.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.59,0:34:45.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.87,0:34:54.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得听我说  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to listen to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.21,0:34:57.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不再安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We aren't safe here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.55,0:34:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这么做我们在外面才会安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we need to do this so that we can be safe out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.83,0:35:01.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得装得像怪物一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to look like the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.32,0:35:02.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要  求你了  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.51,0:35:04.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  我们得走了  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, honey, we have to go, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.99,0:35:06.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须这么做  山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.10,0:35:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  假装你很勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, just-- just pretend you're brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.16,0:35:14.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  就装一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Just make it all pretend.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.23,0:35:18.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都不是真的  你是个不害怕的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, none of this is real and you're somebody who isn't afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.87,0:35:21.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.77,0:35:24.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.68,0:35:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了杀他我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will kill you to kill him
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.90,0:35:32.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我不想再让任何人死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I don't want anyone else to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.24,0:35:36.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.71,0:35:40.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你们都会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're all going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.15,0:35:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不属于这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't belong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.89,0:35:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你很肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me you're sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.57,0:35:50.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你知道会发生什么  是什么结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me you know what'll happen, how it will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.79,0:35:57.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.17,0:36:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.97,0:36:32.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.62,0:36:44.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.63,0:36:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.99,0:36:55.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ron?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.86,0:36:58.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.87,0:37:00.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我去带上朱迪思  -瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll get Judith. - Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.20,0:37:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在外面不会放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna give up out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.07,0:37:07.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会回头  不管发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not turn back, no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.24,0:37:11.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.29,0:37:23.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.90,0:37:26.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.83,0:37:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别哪样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.34,0:37:32.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别杀他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.07,0:37:36.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说他们已经死了  你说我已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said they were already dead you said I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.27,0:37:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没必要杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.73,0:37:40.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们自己死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let us die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.91,0:37:43.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们自己死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let us die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.95,0:37:52.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的都是屁话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so full of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.73,0:37:57.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就喜欢你们身上这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're what I like about people.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.45,0:38:00.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.17,0:38:03.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.87,0:38:07.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别乱动  -别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just be still. - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.74,0:38:09.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.48,0:38:11.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.65,0:38:14.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.72,0:38:16.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丢过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slide them over.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.62,0:38:18.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.81,0:38:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不需要她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.95,0:38:34.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.48,0:38:36.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.85,0:38:39.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.95,0:38:42.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.42,0:38:50.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在外面活不下去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna make it out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.69,0:38:53.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.58,0:42:01.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.39,0:42:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.89,0:42:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.84,0:43:03.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-达里尔  -我看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daryl? - Yeah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.64,0:43:06.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the holy shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.36,0:43:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们为什么不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don’t you come on out?
