Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.59,0:43:23.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们想反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if you want to resist,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.54,0:43:24.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耍花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}try something. I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.48,0:43:26.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是你们的自由  我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}it’s a choice, I guess.
