Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.35,0:43:56.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.17,0:43:59.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一开始就很顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's going well right out of the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.16,0:44:01.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  第二步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, step 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.63,0:44:03.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交出你们的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand over your weapons.
