Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.20,0:44:06.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为武器不是你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they are not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.38,0:44:08.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.64,0:44:11.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}See...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.09,0:44:15.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的武器  卡车  卡车里的汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your weapons, your truck, the fuel in your truck,
